  "details": "Description\n\nI use the ESC key alone to open the menu. This automatically turns on safety mode, which I do not want. It does this every time I open the menu using the ESC key. It's extremely bothersome and annoying. I expect turning safety mode on to have a more complicated key shortcut, so I think this is a bug. \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nThis bug happens almost every time I hit the ESC key to open the menu. It can be temporarily fixed if I try ALT+Tab, but this only lasts a few minutes. \n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p1-1937-299983b13b-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-08_21-41-57.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_4e0610f1-e307-457a-9421-1ee36812810e/1/file)",
